@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title Settings emission: admission and resulting Result
start
:Settings packet arrives
(operator edit or producer observation);
if (Malformed, unrecognized target,\nstale Program/base revision\nor denied authority?) then (yes)
  :Reject before admission;
  note right: No observation created
  stop
else (no)
endif
if (Conflicting explicit fault codes\nin one aggregate?) then (yes)
  :Reject packet;
  stop
else (no)
endif
if (Uniform explicit fault?) then (yes)
  :That fault (e.g. SettingsUnavailable)\nfor the addressed group;
elseif (All payloads validate together?) then (yes)
  :ok(value) for every addressed config;
else (no)
  :fault(SettingsInvalid)\nfor the addressed group;
endif
:Accepted emission advances\nsettings observation revision;
:All consumers at this evaluation\nposition read the same current Result;
stop
@enduml
